9. CMD : used to execute the Commands ( execute the commands after container is created ) we can't use this component multiple times
10. Entrypoint : used to execute the Commands when we create the Container, we can't use this component multiple times.
11. ENV : used to pass the variables inside the Containers  (printenv command)
